          "difficulty": "medium",
          "type": "mc",
          "text": "If <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> − <i>y</i><sup>2</sup> = 64 and <i>x</i> + <i>y</i> = 16, what is the value of <i>x</i> − <i>y</i>?",
